'''New Horizon''' (ニューホライゾン ''Nyū Horaizun'', '''New Horizon''') is the 32nd sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 130th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A surprisingly difficult subchapter to begin the final third of [[Zero Legends]], containing unique enemy synergies that punish sloppy gameplay. Notable examples of enemy pairings include [[Koala's Rest]] (a formidable [[Wave Attack]] stage which features [[Puffzerker]], designed to counter traditional strategies using [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], while also making it difficult to stack [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave-immune units]]) and [[Shadows Abound]]'s onslaught of high-pressure [[Kang Roo]] variants alongside [[Oldstrich]]. Difficulty varies based on one's available units, but most players should expect a challenging experience overall.

