==Trivia==
*The map used in New Horizon through [[Noodle Nirvana]] appears to be a flipped and reversed Australia, along with some other parts of Oceania and Indonesia. New Horizon is themed after Australia in particular:
**Australia is known for its crocodiles, kangaroos, koalas and snakes, all of which appear in New Horizon.
**[[A Vast Red Waste]] refers to the vast wastes of the Australian [[wikipedia:Outback|Outback]] and its red soils.
**[[A Barrier Great]] is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Great Barrier Reef|Great Barrier Reef]], a coral reef system located on the coast of Queensland, Australia.
**[[Arbor Aflame]] may refer to the constant [[wikipedia:Bushfires in Australia|bushfires in Australia]].
**[[The Navel of the Cat]] is a reference to the sandstone monolith [[wikipedia:Uluru|Uluru]], which is also known as the "navel of the world" or "navel of the Earth".

